WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:03.840
Speaker 1: But as I mentioned,&nbsp;
there's the opposite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.920
side of the spectrum that appears to be far&nbsp;
too prevalent within the Republican Party.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:13.200
And those, of course, are the individuals who say,&nbsp;
don't get vaccinated, don't trust the vaccines.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:19.200
There's more of us than there are of them. And&nbsp;
of course, those are the talking points that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:25.600
came out of Sarah Palin at the Turning&nbsp;
Point USA conference this past weekend.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.520
In fact, Palin went as far as to say that&nbsp;
she'll get the vaccine over her dead body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.880
Which you may have wanted to choose your&nbsp;
words a little more carefully there,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:44.160
because we've seen what this virus does.&nbsp;
800000 Americans dead saying over my dead body,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:52.560
probably not the best choice of words there. So&nbsp;
let me read you what Palin had to say during her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:59.760
little Q&amp;A at the TPY USA conference. We were led&nbsp;
to believe that we wouldn't have to have the shot.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:04.480
Well, then they changed their tune. And now those&nbsp;
of us who have had COVID, they're telling us that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:09.280
even though we've had it and we have natural&nbsp;
immunity now that we still have to get a shot,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:17.760
it will be over my dead body that I'll have&nbsp;
to get a shot. I will not do it. Again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:24.000
probably not a good choice of words there. And&nbsp;
of course, before I go into what else, she said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:31.760
natural immunity does not provide you the same&nbsp;
level of protection as the vaccines. The studies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:36.800
have already shown that, yes, natural immunity can&nbsp;
provide you some protection from it. Absolutely.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:43.760
But it doesn't give you as much protection as the&nbsp;
vaccines. So let's dispel with that talking point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:48.080
right off the bat. But let's continue because&nbsp;
this is where things get weird. This is where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:52.880
she differs from Trump. You know, Trump said, Oh,&nbsp;
you, you should get it. But if you don't want to,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:57.760
you don't have to. Palin actively encouraged&nbsp;
people to straight up, not take it at all.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:04.160
Here's what she says. There are more of us&nbsp;
than there are of them. You need to all look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:08.960
around and realize as you stiffen your spine and&nbsp;
take those positions. And we know our rights,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:13.360
especially when it comes to the government telling&nbsp;
us what we have to inject in our own bodies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:18.320
realize that those around you as you stiffen&nbsp;
your spine, their spines will stiffen to.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:27.280
Is spine stiffening a symptom of COVID? Because&nbsp;
if it is, then I think she's spot on there.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.680
But what she said, there's more of us than&nbsp;
there are of you, first of all, no, there's not.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:35.840
There's actually more vaccinated people in this&nbsp;
country than there are unvaccinated people.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:40.480
So right off the bat, you're wrong if&nbsp;
that is in fact what you're talking about.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:45.600
Again, this is Sarah Palin, though, so&nbsp;
we really don't know exactly what she's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:52.560
trying to say or what she might mean, because&nbsp;
that's how Sarah Palin operates. But if you're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:57.360
like me, the biggest shock out&nbsp;
of what Sarah Palin said here.&nbsp;&nbsp;

